   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Tinea versicolor likely • Advise to wear cool clothing in hot weather to reduce perspiration. • Apply selenium sulphide 2.5% suspension. Lather on affected areas. Apply once weekly for 3 weeks: leave on overnight then wash off next day. • May take months for colour to return. Absence of scale indicates adequate treatment. • Recurrence is common. Re-treatment may be needed.",
