   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Patient has acute hepatitis A infection • Notify4 within 7 days. • Educate that infection will resolve by itself and no specific treatment needed. Advise strict handwashing, especially before handling food and after using toilet. Avoid alcohol and paracetamol whilst ill. • Check HBsAg result. If positive, refer. • If nausea/vomiting and unable to tolerate fluids, refer.",
